    ("Digital attention unit compute: QK^T and AV MACs + softmax element ops (+ RoPE for Gemma)", "yes", "dynamic (accelerator-level average)", "MAC-equivalent operations x 1 pJ", "E = (2 P ctx H dh + 4 H P ctx [+ 3 (H + Hkv) dh P]) x 1 pJ x n_layers", "1 pJ per MAC-equivalent op = 2 TOPS/W (Edge TPU class 4 TOPS INT8 at 2 W): a subsystem-equivalent coefficient including the unit's internal buffers and control at full load", "offload.REF_UNIT pj_per_mac; ANCHORS DR-9", "attention of every layer, every forward", "the unit's internal buffer traffic is inside the coefficient and not charged again; K/V memory and hub link are separate lines", "the full-load average folds that accelerator's own static share at 100% utilisation; idle power between forwards not modelled"),
