    ("Model end: embedding read (and OPT position embedding read)", "yes", "dynamic", "tokens x d_model words x 50 pJ", "E = n_tokens x d_model x 50 pJ (+ same for positions)", "50 pJ per word off-chip read (llm_workload.E_DRAM_PER_WORD_J)", "code constant (LPDDR class)", "every token entering a forward", "-", "table resident in the unit's memory; no standby power"),
