    ("Digital unit idle power between forwards", "no", "static", "-", "-", "-", "no idle figure for the device class in the registry", "-", "-", "UNCOVERED"),
    ("K/V memory standby / refresh (LPDDR)", "no", "static", "-", "-", "-", "no standby figure in the registry", "-", "-", "UNCOVERED (magnitude: tens of mW for a 2 GB LPDDR4 package, i.e. ~1 J over a 30 s request)"),
    ("Mesh link PHY: energy model choice", "traffic-based (adopted)", "dynamic", "bits x pJ/bit", "the interconnect line above (10 pJ/word per hop = 1.25 pJ/bit, the registry midpoint of the GRS 0.82-1.75 pJ/bit band)", "Gemini (HPCA 2024) section V-B2: clock-forwarding links such as GRS and UCIe enter low-power states and are priced by traffic volume x unit energy; clock-embedded SerDes by link count x power x time; its Simba (GRS) baseline uses the traffic-based model", "analysis/ANCHORS.md amendment 2026-10-22", "all tiers; the residual power of the low-power state is not modelled", "the per-bit constant is the same PHY energy as the all-links-on scenario, so the two are alternatives, never summed", "the repository note 'traffic-independent, no sleep' (SIMBA_PREREG T-table) is not supported by the Gemini reading and is treated as unverified"),
